<title>EGYPT: Egyptian company bought 60,000 T raw sugar.</title>
<headline>Egyptian company bought 60,000 T raw sugar.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian company Multi Trade bought 60,000 tonnes of raw sugar on Tuesday, half of the amount from Louis Dreyfus, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Price and other details were not immediately available but traders said delivery was believed to be between July and September 1997.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
